          "text": "May God bless Serbia and the former Yugoslavia. Greetings from Romania. I wish you all the best in the world, my brothers and sisters. You are the only neighbor with whom we have never had a conflict.\nRespect, @AlexM-t6h. Always love your country unconditionally.\nOur ancestors died with the sword in hand to preserve our land.",
